  {
   "article_number": 244,
   "bab": 12,
   "article_title_ar": "تصفية الشركة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "8769fe4586590701f45f0b3fb2f8b084a66843ef171a4312a6eefd81f503da09",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "a5f3e32eceb977af91e53c0b98303356a7a1cd1736645f8bce26b7c2bf1be72a",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-244",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "c10a4653839bf306549038bde54f3edbaab490d2ab28d21fe5ef22d5cf76720f",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "公司依照本法规定消灭时进入清算阶段，合伙人、股东大会或股东应采取清算程序，公司在清算所需的限度内保留法人资格。\n若公司因本法所规定的任一消灭事由而消灭，则合伙人、股东、公司经理或其董事会（视情形而定）应编制本法第（二百四十二）条第（一）款所述说明，但该说明在公司消灭前已编制、且自其编制之日起未超过（三十）日者除外。\n若公司消灭时其资产不足以偿付其债务、或依照破产法陷入财务困境，则其应向主管司法机关提出请求，依照破产法启动任一清算程序。\n若违反本条规定对公司进行清算，则合伙人、股东、公司经理或其董事会成员（视情形而定）对公司剩余的任何债务负连带责任。\n公众非营利公司非经取得部的同意不得清算。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "c706da1a367083b68fe619ab74c87c916ee69a8ab623d203ccba08be603664d1",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 248,
   "bab": 12,
   "article_title_ar": "قرار تعيين المصفي",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "6e3169afa91a412f580117907116d7a111af60e9a65af8e9fcbc305568230999",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "9a478c8964663dd228bfbcfb9d41c276b0437e2351acb867f5054e2366212eb9",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-248",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "d1f95a536b579055e51c0a1c0d55736d9b7c5a666a33d353f0b6d272ca607868",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "清算人的任命，由合伙人、股东大会或股东依照按公司形式修改其设立合同或基本章程所确定的程序，在公司消灭之日起不超过（六十）日内以决议作出。若在该期限内无法任命清算人，则由主管司法机关根据任一合伙人、股东或利害关系人提出的请求以决议任命。\n作为本条第（一）款的例外，若公司消灭系因终审判决将其解散或宣告无效所致，则由作出该判决的司法机关以决议任命清算人。\n主管司法机关在依照本条第（一）款和第（二）款作出任命清算人的决议前，应要求合伙人、股东、公司经理或其董事会（视情形而定）在请求之日起不超过（三十）日内提交本法第（二百四十二）条第（一）款所述说明、或所需的说明和会计记录、或财务报表（如有），以证明公司资产足以在本编所规定清算期结束时偿付其债务、且公司未依照破产法陷入财务困境；若主管司法机关认为公司资产不足以偿付其债务，则应采取必要措施依照破产法启动任一清算程序。\n在任何情形下，任命清算人的决议均应载明其权限、报酬、对其施加的限制（如有）以及清算所需的期限。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "78c91e67dfc7da1be2cb09b6a6a73fdbf1c1391d6a7c38bc1cd09db3ba363ee3",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
